{
  "uid": "quizlabs-overview",
  "title": "QuizLabs - Overview",
  "description": "Central legacy-stack view: quiz-backend, quiz-multiplayer/Socket.IO, MongoDB and Redis. Kubernetes/resource/storage signals and namespace-bound edge traffic only; no invented application metrics.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": ["homelab-monitoring"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "links": [{"type": "dashboards", "tags": ["homelab-monitoring"], "title": "Monitoring", "asDropdown": true, "keepTime": true}],
  "templating": {"list": [
    {"name": "metrics", "label": "Prometheus", "type": "datasource", "query": "prometheus"},
    {"name": "logs", "label": "Loki", "type": "datasource", "query": "loki"}
  ]},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "One bounded view of the legacy stack",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 5},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "**quiz-backend**, **quiz-multiplayer / Socket.IO**, **MongoDB**, **Redis** are scoped to **quizlabs**. Envoy runs in envoy-gateway-system; its panels below select only `httproute/quizlabs/quizlabs/` clusters (rule 0 backend, rule 1 Socket.IO, rule 2 frontend). They are proxy requests/connections, **not players, rooms, successful games, message delivery or WebSocket session counts**. Shared cloudflared data stays on Platform.\n\nThere are no MongoDB/Redis application exporters in this phase: readiness/resources/PVC/logs are evidence, not database command latency or replication health. Legacy unstructured logs remain raw; no regex counts pretend to be failures. Missing data is unknown. [QuizLabs runbook](https://github.com/liav-hasson/homelab/blob/main/k8s/platform/monitoring/runbook.md#quizlabs)"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "table", "title": "Backend, multiplayer, frontend and Redis: available / desired replicas",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"quizlabs\"} / on (namespace, deployment) kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=\"quizlabs\"}", "instant": true, "format": "table"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "table", "title": "MongoDB: ready / desired StatefulSet replicas",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 5, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "kube_statefulset_status_replicas_ready{namespace=\"quizlabs\"} / on (namespace, statefulset) kube_statefulset_replicas{namespace=\"quizlabs\"}", "instant": true, "format": "table"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs route upstream requests / 15 minutes",
      "description": "Edge scrape namespace is envoy-gateway-system; route cluster prefix enforces QuizLabs traffic isolation. HTTP polling/upgrade requests are not game messages.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 13, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (envoy_cluster_name) (increase(envoy_cluster_upstream_rq_total{namespace=\"envoy-gateway-system\",envoy_cluster_name=~\"httproute/quizlabs/quizlabs/.*\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{envoy_cluster_name}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs route upstream connect failures and timeouts / 15 minutes",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 13, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (envoy_cluster_name) (increase(envoy_cluster_upstream_cx_connect_fail{namespace=\"envoy-gateway-system\",envoy_cluster_name=~\"httproute/quizlabs/quizlabs/.*\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "connect fail {{envoy_cluster_name}}"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (envoy_cluster_name) (increase(envoy_cluster_upstream_rq_timeout{namespace=\"envoy-gateway-system\",envoy_cluster_name=~\"httproute/quizlabs/quizlabs/.*\"}[15m]))", "legendFormat": "timeout {{envoy_cluster_name}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Socket.IO route active proxy connections (not users or sessions)",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 21, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (envoy_cluster_name) (envoy_cluster_upstream_cx_active{namespace=\"envoy-gateway-system\",envoy_cluster_name=\"httproute/quizlabs/quizlabs/rule/1\"})", "legendFormat": "{{envoy_cluster_name}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs container restarts / 15 minutes",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 21, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"quizlabs\"}[15m])", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{container}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs container CPU",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 28, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "cores", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (pod, container) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"quizlabs\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{container}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs container memory working set",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 28, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "max by (pod, container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"quizlabs\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"})", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{container}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs memory working set / configured limit",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 35, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percent", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "100 * max by (namespace, pod, container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"quizlabs\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}) / on (namespace, pod, container) (max by (namespace, pod, container) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"quizlabs\",resource=\"memory\",unit=\"byte\"}) > 0)", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{container}}"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "table", "title": "Recent OOM restarts",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 35, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "(kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"quizlabs\",reason=\"OOMKilled\"} == 1) and on (namespace, pod, container) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"quizlabs\"}[15m]) > 0)", "instant": true, "format": "table"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "timeseries", "title": "QuizLabs data-store PVC used / capacity",
      "description": "Includes MongoDB/Redis volumes reported by kubelet; no exporter or invented datastore command metrics.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 42, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "max by (persistentvolumeclaim) (kubelet_volume_stats_used_bytes{namespace=\"quizlabs\"})", "legendFormat": "used {{persistentvolumeclaim}}"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "max by (persistentvolumeclaim) (kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes{namespace=\"quizlabs\"})", "legendFormat": "capacity {{persistentvolumeclaim}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "table", "title": "QuizLabs Flux delivery state",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 42, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${metrics}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "gotk_resource_info{exported_namespace=\"quizlabs\"}", "instant": true, "format": "table"}]
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "logs", "title": "quiz-backend logs only",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 49, "w": 24, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${logs}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{namespace=\"quizlabs\",app=\"quiz-backend\"}", "queryType": "range"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    },
    {
      "id": 15, "type": "logs", "title": "quiz-multiplayer / Socket.IO logs only",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 57, "w": 24, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${logs}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{namespace=\"quizlabs\",app=\"quiz-multiplayer\"}", "queryType": "range"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    },
    {
      "id": 16, "type": "logs", "title": "QuizLabs MongoDB logs only",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 65, "w": 24, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${logs}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{namespace=\"quizlabs\",app=\"mongodb\"}", "queryType": "range"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    },
    {
      "id": 17, "type": "logs", "title": "QuizLabs Redis logs only",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 73, "w": 24, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "${logs}"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "{namespace=\"quizlabs\",app=\"redis\"}", "queryType": "range"}],
      "options": {"showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending"}
    }
  ]
}
